        <div class="inrow" data-row="A.VAP-A.mC" data-th="vap_mC"><span class="lbl">ENERGY (mC)<small>91,8 ± 1,4 mC (90,4 – 93,2)</small></span><div class="hstack-tight"><input class="grow" inputmode="decimal" data-k="A.VAP-A.mC" value="" placeholder="" aria-label="ENERGY (mC)"><button type="button" class="btn-ocr-scan" data-scan-for="A.VAP-A.mC" title="Quét số đo bằng camera (OCR)" aria-label="Quét số cho ENERGY (mC)">📷</button></div></div><div class="inrow" data-row="A.VAP-A.V" data-th="vap_V"><span class="lbl">ENERGY (V)<small>≥ 900 V</small></span><div class="hstack-tight"><input class="grow" inputmode="decimal" data-k="A.VAP-A.V" value="" placeholder="" aria-label="ENERGY (V)"><button type="button" class="btn-ocr-scan" data-scan-for="A.VAP-A.V" title="Quét số đo bằng camera (OCR)" aria-label="Quét số cho ENERGY (V)">📷</button></div></div><div class="inrow" data-row="A.VAP-A.A" data-th="vap_A"><span class="lbl">CURRENT (A)<small>trị tuyệt đối · 4,5 ± 0,14 A (4,36 – 4,64)</small></span><div class="hstack-tight"><input class="grow" inputmode="decimal" data-k="A.VAP-A.A" value="" placeholder="" aria-label="CURRENT (A)"><button type="button" class="btn-ocr-scan" data-scan-for="A.VAP-A.A" title="Quét số đo bằng camera (OCR)" aria-label="Quét số cho CURRENT (A)">📷</button></div></div><div class="inrow" data-row="A.VAP-A.ext" data-th="vap_ext"><span class="lbl">EXT TRIG (V)<small>tùy chọn · 800 ± 25 V (775 – 825)</small></span><div class="hstack-tight"><input class="grow" inputmode="decimal" data-k="A.VAP-A.ext" value="" placeholder="" aria-label="EXT TRIG (V)"><button type="button" class="btn-ocr-scan" data-scan-for="A.VAP-A.ext" title="Quét số đo bằng camera (OCR)" aria-label="Quét số cho EXT TRIG (V)">📷</button></div></div>
